:"[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-].[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-038020","value":"8.2","numeric":8.2}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-038021","Abbreviation_in_the_article":1,"Cell_line":"MDA-MB-231","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":148.6,"IC50_Dark_value":148.6,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1021/jm501095r","Year":2014,"Counterion":"[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-].[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-038021","value":"13.6","numeric":13.6}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-038022","Abbreviation_in_the_article":1,"Cell_line":"PC-3","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":199.2,"IC50_Dark_value":199.2,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1021/jm501095r","Year":2014,"Counterion":"[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-].[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-038022","value":"10.5","numeric":10.5}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-038023","Abbreviation_in_the_article":1,"Cell_line":"HeLa","Time(h)":48,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":159.9,"IC50_Dark_value":159.9,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1021/jm501095r","Year":2014,"Counterion":"[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-].[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-]","Type":"IC50","comparison":{"compound_id":"OBMD011700","measurement_id":"MCTM-038023","value":"5.2","numeric":5.2}},{"Measurement_ID":"MCTM-039192","Abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru2(PF6)2","Cell_line":"MCF-7","Time(h)":24,"IC50_Dark(M*10^-6)":17,"IC50_Dark_value":17,"Method":"MTT","DOI":"10.1021/acsami.6b07038","Year":2016,"Counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F.F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","Type":"IC50"}],"logp":[{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"CC-8","value":-1.15,"value_relation":"=","std":0.2,"type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"10 mM phosphate buffer","pH":7,"doi":"10.1016/j.jinorgbio.2020.111080","year":2020,"counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F.F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","record_id":"MLDB-000443","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"The lipophilicity of each complex was determined experimentally with the partition coefficient (Log Po/w). The method used was the “shake flask” [46], in which a buffer of phosphates 0.01 M at pH 7.00 is used as an aqueous phase and 1-octanol as an organic phase. A 1 × 10-5 M solution of the complex is prepared in octanol, then mixed with the aqueous phase in a one to one ratio for 5 min, stirring vigorously in a magnetic stirring plate. The mixture is left for a period of 6 h to achieve a good separation of the phases. Concentration of the complex in both phases is then calculated by UV–vis spectroscopy. Each measurement was repeated 3 times."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":1,"value":-1.09,"value_relation":"=","std":0.05,"type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","temperature_C":25,"doi":"10.1039/c9dt01594a","year":2019,"counterion":"[Cl-].[Cl-]","record_id":"MLDB-001221","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"Oil/water partition coefficients (logPO/W) were measured at ambient temperature. The examined complexes (40 μM) dissolved in 1 mL water were mixed with 1 mL n-octanol and sonicated for 30 min before being centrifuged at 4000 rpm for 10 min. The two phases could then be separated and measured on a UV-Vis spectrophotometer to determine the concentrations of complexes. The oil/water partition coefficients were calculated using the equation: logPo/w = logCo/Cw, where Co is the concentration of the complex in octanol and Cw is the concentration of the complex in the water phase. Each measurement was repeated 3 times."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":1,"value":-2.5,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"0.9% NaCl","temperature_C":25,"doi":"10.1021/jm501095r","year":2014,"counterion":"[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-].[O-][Cl+3]([O-])([O-])[O-]","record_id":"MLDB-001533","detection":"ICP-MS","method_description":"Lipophilicity was presented as log Po/w values, which were determined by the flask-shaking method. An aliquot of a stock solution of the ruthenium complex in aqueous NaCl (0.9% w/v and saturated with octanol) was added to an equal volume of octanol (saturated with 0.9% NaCl w/v), and the mixture was shaken overnight at 60 rpm to allow partitioning at 298 K. After the sample was centrifuged at 3000 rpm for 10 min, the aqueous layer was carefully separated from the octanol layer for ruthenium analysis. The Ru concentration in the aqueous phase was determined by ICP-MS and used to calculate the [Ru]O/[Ru]W ratio."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru2Cl2","value":-2.53,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","temperature_C":25,"doi":"10.1021/acsami.6b07038","year":2016,"counterion":"[Cl-].[Cl-]","record_id":"MLDB-005025","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"The partition coefficients (log P) were measured according to the reported procedure with minor modification. Aqueous solution of ruthenium complex with counter ion of Cl or PF6 was prepared at 50 uM. Then an equal volume of n-octanol was added. The two phases were mutually saturated by shaking 12 h at 25 C and allowed to separate by centrifugation. The concentration of the metal complex in each phase was determined on a UV-Vis spectrophotometer at maximum MLCT absorption wavelength."},{"abbreviation_in_the_article":"Ru2(PF6)2","value":-1.76,"value_relation":"=","type_authors":"logP","method":"shake-flask","aqueous_phase":"water","temperature_C":25,"doi":"10.1021/acsami.6b07038","year":2016,"counterion":"F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F.F[P-](F)(F)(F)(F)F","record_id":"MLDB-005026","detection":"UV-Vis","method_description":"The partition coefficients (log P) were measured according to the reported procedure with minor modification. Aqueous solution of ruthenium complex with counter ion of Cl or PF6 was prepared at 50 uM. Then an equal volume of n-octanol was added. The two phases were mutually saturated by shaking 12 h at 25 C and allowed to separate by centrifugation. The concentration of the metal complex in each phase was determined on a UV-Vis spectrophotometer at maximum MLCT absorption wavelength."}],"ccdc":["NUYDIX"]}